  "caption": "검색 한 번에\n적립금・이력・예약 조회까지\n\nTake a Seat는 어느 화면에서나\n고객 검색이 가능해요.\n이름으로도, 번호 뒷자리로도요.\n\n고객정보에서\n적립금 잔액과 이력,\n예약 내역까지 조회가 가능해요.\n\n언제 얼마가 적립되고 쓰였는지\n건별로 남아요.\n\n적립은 방식 선택도 가능해요.\n결제 금액 퍼센트 자동 적립과\n선불금 충전, 둘 다 쓸 수 있어요.\n\n적립·차감을 직접 하는 것도\n고객정보에서 바로 가능해요 🙂\n\n프로필 링크에서\nhttps://takeaseat.co.kr 확인하세요 🔗\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯\n\nOne search, and it is all in one place.\n\nTake a Seat keeps customer search one tap\naway from any screen — by name, or by the\nlast digits of a phone number.\n\nOpen a customer and you get the point\nbalance, the full ledger, and the visit\nhistory: what was earned, what was spent,\nwhen, and the balance after each line.\n\nEarning has two modes and you can run\neither or both — a percentage of the paid\namount, added the moment a payment is\nmarked complete, and prepaid top-ups you\nmanage per customer.\n\nLink in bio\nhttps://takeaseat.co.kr 🔗\n\n#TAS #적립금 #고객관리 #공방운영 #pikaworks",
